1
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:14,360
(11:50-12:00 PM)

2
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:19,400
(11:50-12:00 PM)

3
00:00:20,653 --> 00:00:23,760
♪Your silhouette melts into the glow♪

4
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:26,680
(Congrats to our grand prize winner!
Prize money: 100,000 yuan)

5
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:30,872
♪I count your sighs♪

6
00:00:32,482 --> 00:00:34,680
♪Every breath♪

7
00:00:34,804 --> 00:00:37,560
♪Feels like I'm stealing♪

8
00:00:39,630 --> 00:00:41,157
♪The next second♪

9
00:00:41,604 --> 00:00:44,357
♪Before it's no longer mine♪

10
00:00:48,023 --> 00:00:50,628
♪We live♪
(Capernaum)

11
00:00:50,628 --> 00:00:54,277
♪In the spaces between moments♪

12
00:00:56,210 --> 00:01:00,840
♪Breathing through each other's shadows♪

13
00:01:02,243 --> 00:01:05,000
♪Let's not speak of what's to come♪

14
00:01:05,317 --> 00:01:08,177
♪Or what came before♪

15
00:01:09,769 --> 00:01:14,589
♪This moment could last me a lifetime♪
(12:00-11:50 PM)

16
00:01:17,880 --> 00:01:21,000
=Thirteen Types of Love=
=Episode 10=

17
00:01:28,800 --> 00:01:29,200
Lin Duo.

18
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:30,680
(Universe D250.)

19
00:01:31,080 --> 00:01:32,920
(The original host regained control.)

20
00:01:32,920 --> 00:01:33,680
Jiang Cheng!

21
00:01:33,840 --> 00:01:34,360
Send me back!

22
00:01:34,479 --> 00:01:35,079
Duo's still alive!

23
00:01:35,080 --> 00:01:36,240
- Calm down!
- Are you listening?

24
00:01:36,240 --> 00:01:36,960
- Listen to me!
- I have to save her!

25
00:01:36,960 --> 00:01:37,640
Listen!

26
00:01:39,040 --> 00:01:39,880
I warned you.

27
00:01:40,240 --> 00:01:42,160
Rely too much on the host's abilities,

28
00:01:42,360 --> 00:01:43,560
and your consciousness will be consumed.

29
00:01:43,560 --> 00:01:44,560
You'll disappear.

30
00:01:46,360 --> 00:01:47,400
Stop wasting time.

31
00:01:47,880 --> 00:01:49,120
Move on to the next universe.

32
00:01:52,960 --> 00:01:53,920
Once I get there, I'll kill myself.

33
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:55,600
Let's see which one of us

34
00:01:55,720 --> 00:01:57,240
ends up wasting more time.

35
00:01:58,640 --> 00:01:59,800
If you waste time

36
00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:01,200
and get Lin Duo killed in this universe,

37
00:02:01,760 --> 00:02:03,000
I'm done helping you.

38
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:17,600
Don't you want to restore your universe

39
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:19,920
and get your Lin Duo back?

40
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:22,360
Every universe

41
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:23,920
is something Lin Duo and I imagined.

42
00:02:24,480 --> 00:02:25,560
I could spend the rest of my life

43
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:26,960
imagining a perfect universe,

44
00:02:27,840 --> 00:02:29,680
if your theory's true.

45
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:33,640
Once people become self-aware,

46
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:36,120
their goals sure are sharp and intense.

47
00:02:37,160 --> 00:02:37,880
Send me back now.

48
00:02:38,200 --> 00:02:38,960
I know how to save her.

49
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:43,120
The system has realized

50
00:02:43,320 --> 00:02:45,280
you're an entity that shouldn't exist
in your original universe.

51
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:47,280
It's like a splinter in your body.

52
00:02:47,880 --> 00:02:49,360
Your immune system rejects it.

53
00:02:49,760 --> 00:02:51,280
Every time you reload, it warns you

54
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:53,400
that you don't belong there.

55
00:02:53,920 --> 00:02:55,680
Cross the threshold and you're flagged.

56
00:02:56,160 --> 00:02:57,240
Then you'll be...

57
00:03:02,640 --> 00:03:05,280
(You are about to enter Universe D250.)

58
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:15,240
Where am I?

59
00:03:16,160 --> 00:03:16,840
Lin Duo?

60
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:20,160
Boss.

61
00:03:20,720 --> 00:03:22,440
Who's Lin Duo?

62
00:03:24,280 --> 00:03:25,360
Bloody Rose.

63
00:03:25,680 --> 00:03:26,800
Equinox.

64
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:30,520
Lin Duo.

65
00:03:31,760 --> 00:03:33,320
English is actually pretty easy.

66
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:35,160
A jeep is...

67
00:03:35,160 --> 00:03:35,720
a jeep.

68
00:03:36,440 --> 00:03:37,040
A tank is...

69
00:03:37,040 --> 00:03:37,680
a tank.

70
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:39,000
Lin Duo is...

71
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:40,000
Lin Duo.

72
00:03:43,880 --> 00:03:44,760
So...

73
00:03:45,920 --> 00:03:47,520
you're the Boss.

74
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:52,480
You made the two organizations
infiltrate

75
00:03:52,480 --> 00:03:55,120
and purge each other from the start.

76
00:03:56,040 --> 00:03:56,920
It's the only way

77
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:59,840
to establish a new order.

78
00:04:01,160 --> 00:04:02,720
No matter how well they're trained,

79
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:05,960
they can't match a synthetic like 3-301.

80
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:07,360
It only obeys orders.

81
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:10,640
Only yours.

82
00:04:25,840 --> 00:04:27,720
3-301.

83
00:04:30,200 --> 00:04:31,360
It obeys only me?

84
00:04:32,400 --> 00:04:33,400
Only you.

85
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:34,680
Only me?

86
00:04:34,960 --> 00:04:36,040
Only you.

87
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:38,320
Think of something, quick!

88
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:40,920
Boss.

89
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:43,680
Start drawing blood.

90
00:04:45,280 --> 00:04:47,960
Use stronger genes to reshape it

91
00:04:48,720 --> 00:04:51,920
into a body better suited
to daily missions.

92
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:52,560
Shut up.

93
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:53,760
You talk too much.

94
00:04:53,840 --> 00:04:54,600
Why can't you keep your mouth shut?

95
00:04:55,280 --> 00:04:56,240
Yes, Boss.

96
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:00,840
You.

97
00:05:02,760 --> 00:05:03,680
Stand over there.

98
00:05:17,200 --> 00:05:17,960
What are you doing?

99
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:19,760
The Boss must

100
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:21,240
have his reasons for doing this.

101
00:05:21,640 --> 00:05:22,200
Are you okay?

102
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:24,040
Are you okay?

103
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:29,840
Hey, kid.

104
00:05:30,480 --> 00:05:31,920
Don't blow our cover.

105
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:34,240
Get up.

106
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,000
Are your wrists okay? Let me see.

107
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:38,280
Are your wrists okay? Let me see.

108
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:42,640
Boss.

109
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:44,240
Like this?

110
00:05:45,440 --> 00:05:46,120
Close enough.

111
00:05:50,160 --> 00:05:50,960
You...

112
00:05:52,960 --> 00:05:54,400
are not the Boss, are you?

113
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:19,080
3-301.

114
00:06:22,040 --> 00:06:23,240
Pick those two up.

115
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:27,320
Crush whichever one blinks.

116
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:29,120
Don't blink!

117
00:06:29,600 --> 00:06:30,320
Boss.

118
00:06:30,520 --> 00:06:31,360
Night Owl.

119
00:06:31,880 --> 00:06:32,720
And Yongsen.

120
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:34,920
You can take your time
figuring out who I am.

121
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:35,800
Move.

122
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:43,080
Don't blink!

123
00:06:44,640 --> 00:06:46,960
Who's this Yongsen guy?

124
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:10,600
Duo,

125
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:11,440
if you can't take it,

126
00:07:11,440 --> 00:07:12,040
just scream.

127
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:14,760
Or bite down on this.

128
00:07:16,040 --> 00:07:17,440
I don't feel a thing.

129
00:07:20,720 --> 00:07:21,440
Choo-choo!

130
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:41,440
Did you forget our antidote?

131
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:43,360
Boss.

132
00:07:45,320 --> 00:07:45,840
We're screwed.

133
00:07:48,040 --> 00:07:49,400
There's one more person who knows.

134
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:56,320
Actually, I've got another way.

135
00:07:58,120 --> 00:07:58,880
Make me fall in love with you?

136
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:01,040
Exactly.

137
00:08:08,080 --> 00:08:09,000
Why did you come back?

138
00:08:10,880 --> 00:08:11,840
You knew I'd left?

139
00:08:18,400 --> 00:08:19,160
The moment you spoke,

140
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:25,520
I knew you weren't him.

141
00:08:26,120 --> 00:08:26,760
So,

142
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:28,640
you know when I'm me

143
00:08:28,640 --> 00:08:29,680
and when I'm not?

144
00:08:30,120 --> 00:08:31,440
You even know where I'm from

145
00:08:31,440 --> 00:08:32,240
and what I'm here to do?

146
00:08:41,640 --> 00:08:43,200
Assuming you don't have
a split personality,

147
00:08:43,880 --> 00:08:45,240
I thought back on

148
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:46,120
all the short dramas I've watched.

149
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:47,160
It pretty much fits.

150
00:08:48,280 --> 00:08:49,920
But there's one thing I don't get.

151
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:53,480
Why did you come back?

152
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:57,280
Because you're my wife.

153
00:08:57,280 --> 00:08:58,680
How could I let someone else guard you?

154
00:08:59,320 --> 00:09:00,760
You can't even protect anyone.

155
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:02,480
So that excuse doesn't work.

156
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:10,320
So you didn't

157
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:11,520
deny the first part, did you?

158
00:09:12,440 --> 00:09:12,920
What?

159
00:09:13,880 --> 00:09:14,400
Nothing.

160
00:09:16,040 --> 00:09:17,280
I know I'm not strong enough

161
00:09:17,280 --> 00:09:18,880
to protect you all the time.

162
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:21,440
But I can't leave you.

163
00:09:24,200 --> 00:09:24,920
In this universe,

164
00:09:24,920 --> 00:09:26,640
I'm nothing but dead weight to you.

165
00:09:27,880 --> 00:09:29,080
But I still can't leave.

166
00:09:30,640 --> 00:09:32,120
Even if you get hurt because of me,

167
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:32,800
or I distract you and hold you back,

168
00:09:34,080 --> 00:09:35,160
I still won't leave you.

169
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:37,440
Wherever you go,

170
00:09:38,760 --> 00:09:39,760
I'll find you.

171
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:45,440
If you could fight as well as you talk,

172
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:48,240
you'd be scarier than 3-301.

173
00:09:56,320 --> 00:09:56,880
Lin Duo...

174
00:09:58,880 --> 00:09:59,520
I love you.

175
00:10:01,360 --> 00:10:01,840
Don't say it.

176
00:10:03,920 --> 00:10:04,600
You're not him.

177
00:10:05,760 --> 00:10:06,760
You're going to leave.

178
00:10:07,800 --> 00:10:08,800
I never know

179
00:10:10,760 --> 00:10:11,880
when you might just disappear.

180
00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:16,800
So you've already started imagining

181
00:10:18,920 --> 00:10:20,440
our future together?

182
00:10:24,280 --> 00:10:24,720
I...

183
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:25,600
Thanks for loving me.

184
00:10:27,320 --> 00:10:28,040
I love you even more.

185
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:30,040
I don't love you.

186
00:10:34,600 --> 00:10:36,200
(YAA D62651)
My stomach hurt. The power went out.

187
00:10:36,440 --> 00:10:37,320
So I had to climb 20 floors.

188
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:38,880
Then my keys were still in the car.

189
00:10:40,920 --> 00:10:42,080
I told you 18 jokes.

190
00:10:42,720 --> 00:10:43,440
And that's the one you laughed at.

191
00:10:48,840 --> 00:10:50,840
Did you keep reloading
to pump me for information

192
00:10:52,920 --> 00:10:54,320
and study my reactions?

193
00:10:57,840 --> 00:10:58,280
Answer me.

194
00:11:05,760 --> 00:11:06,680
No matter how much I study you,

195
00:11:07,560 --> 00:11:08,720
it's all to win you over.

196
00:11:16,920 --> 00:11:19,040
The clatter of my horse's hooves
is a beautiful mistake.

197
00:11:20,040 --> 00:11:21,760
I'm not a returning traveler.
Just a passerby.

198
00:11:27,800 --> 00:11:28,640
Mr. Passerby.

199
00:11:32,200 --> 00:11:33,240
The cure

200
00:11:33,680 --> 00:11:34,800
seems to be gone.

201
00:11:42,880 --> 00:11:43,280
Lin Duo.

202
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:45,640
I love you.

203
00:11:49,400 --> 00:11:50,120
Is that a proposal?

204
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:19,920
Zhang Yongsen!

205
00:12:21,440 --> 00:12:22,400
I won't let you die!

206
00:12:23,800 --> 00:12:25,880
You can start over endlessly, can't you?

207
00:12:26,360 --> 00:12:27,840
You can't die! Do you hear me?

208
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:29,080
I won't let you die!

209
00:12:29,717 --> 00:12:31,760
♪I've said it too many times♪

210
00:12:32,880 --> 00:12:34,960
We agreed on this.

211
00:12:37,280 --> 00:12:38,360
If he lived,

212
00:12:39,360 --> 00:12:41,200
we couldn't control
when Night Owl would take over.

213
00:12:42,360 --> 00:12:43,680
We'd all end up dead.

214
00:12:45,560 --> 00:12:46,760
It was his choice.

215
00:12:49,523 --> 00:12:53,960
♪This is a story about you♪

216
00:12:56,875 --> 00:12:58,440
♪Your very existence♪

217
00:12:59,155 --> 00:13:01,720
♪Feels like an unfinished dream♪

218
00:13:04,775 --> 00:13:09,200
♪Through one world after another♪

219
00:13:12,400 --> 00:13:13,440
What if she didn't fall for you?

220
00:13:14,480 --> 00:13:15,720
Then the medicine would've been wasted.

221
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:21,240
Of course I made sure.

222
00:13:21,677 --> 00:13:22,839
♪You're where my time ends♪

223
00:13:22,840 --> 00:13:23,600
When?

224
00:13:24,150 --> 00:13:25,583
♪My way forward♪

225
00:13:25,600 --> 00:13:26,560
How come I didn't know

226
00:13:27,400 --> 00:13:28,160
my bestie

227
00:13:28,879 --> 00:13:30,319
had a romance mode?

228
00:13:30,320 --> 00:13:33,280
♪As the monsoon shifts around the bend♪

229
00:13:33,417 --> 00:13:36,263
♪I'm still where we first met♪

230
00:13:36,280 --> 00:13:37,360
Me standing here now

231
00:13:38,639 --> 00:13:40,679
is the result of 19 reloads.

232
00:13:40,680 --> 00:13:42,799
♪You're still my one and only song♪

233
00:13:42,800 --> 00:13:44,080
The first 18 weren't romantic?

234
00:13:45,320 --> 00:13:46,680
You both died the first 18 times.

235
00:13:48,390 --> 00:13:49,883
♪At the end of time♪

236
00:13:50,403 --> 00:13:52,283
♪I wait for your echo♪

237
00:13:52,360 --> 00:13:54,400
I can't stop Night Owl from taking over.

238
00:13:55,680 --> 00:13:57,240
Whenever I sense I'm in danger,

239
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:01,000
his consciousness forcibly
takes over this body.

240
00:14:02,120 --> 00:14:03,000
As long as I'm alive,

241
00:14:04,400 --> 00:14:05,680
Duo will always be in danger.

242
00:14:12,520 --> 00:14:13,680
So you have to kill me.

243
00:14:17,320 --> 00:14:18,080
Somewhere Night Owl

244
00:14:19,200 --> 00:14:20,480
can't sense the danger.

245
00:14:21,430 --> 00:14:23,880
♪You're where my time ends♪

246
00:14:24,110 --> 00:14:25,720
♪My way forward♪

247
00:14:25,903 --> 00:14:27,400
♪Every tide♪

248
00:14:27,569 --> 00:14:29,440
♪Gives way to you♪

249
00:14:29,676 --> 00:14:32,279
♪As the monsoon shifts around the bend♪

250
00:14:32,280 --> 00:14:32,920
Zhang Yongsen!

251
00:14:34,240 --> 00:14:34,960
Wake up!

252
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:37,640
Wake up, Zhang Yongsen!

253
00:14:38,640 --> 00:14:39,560
Wake up!

254
00:14:40,880 --> 00:14:42,160
Zhang Yongsen!

255
00:14:42,160 --> 00:14:43,999
♪You're still my one and only song♪

256
00:14:44,350 --> 00:14:48,237
♪Though the world breaks into dust♪

257
00:14:48,324 --> 00:14:49,640
♪At the end of time♪

258
00:14:50,239 --> 00:14:51,159
♪I wait for your echo♪

259
00:14:51,160 --> 00:14:53,640
What a shame.

260
00:14:55,440 --> 00:14:57,280
So close.

261
00:14:59,200 --> 00:15:01,840
Just a tiny bit more,

262
00:15:04,480 --> 00:15:05,640
and we would've succeeded.

263
00:15:06,480 --> 00:15:07,320
Not missing a thing.

264
00:15:12,240 --> 00:15:13,120
She fell in love with me.

265
00:15:15,920 --> 00:15:17,560
And N9 was injected into her body.

266
00:15:21,080 --> 00:15:22,800
Lin Duo in my universe will live.

267
00:17:05,710 --> 00:17:09,240
♪Does fate write every hello♪

268
00:17:09,270 --> 00:17:11,250
♪With a goodbye in mind?♪

269
00:17:17,190 --> 00:17:20,670
♪Does longing give us a beginning♪

270
00:17:20,790 --> 00:17:22,720
♪And leave us without an ending?♪

271
00:17:28,770 --> 00:17:33,510
♪I remember the way you breathe♪

272
00:17:34,780 --> 00:17:37,560
♪Countless versions of me♪

273
00:17:38,340 --> 00:17:43,960
♪All point in the same direction♪

274
00:17:44,460 --> 00:17:47,520
♪Toward you♪

275
00:17:49,690 --> 00:17:51,320
♪I'll find you♪

276
00:17:51,660 --> 00:17:54,600
♪In the silence as the world is reborn♪

277
00:17:55,080 --> 00:17:56,980
♪I'll find you♪

278
00:17:57,300 --> 00:18:00,200
♪In the instant
before anything is decided♪

279
00:18:00,760 --> 00:18:02,520
♪I'll find you♪

280
00:18:03,120 --> 00:18:05,920
♪In the gaps
where time overlaps and slips♪

281
00:18:06,530 --> 00:18:08,290
♪I'll find you♪

282
00:18:12,620 --> 00:18:14,320
♪I'll find you♪

283
00:18:14,440 --> 00:18:17,480
♪In the promises left unsaid♪

284
00:18:17,930 --> 00:18:19,530
♪I'll find you♪

285
00:18:20,100 --> 00:18:22,840
♪In every pause between heartbeats♪

